config_schema:
example config:
{
  "tenant_id": "acct_123",
  "residency": "EU_ONLY",
  "allow_regions": ["eu-west-1", "eu-central-1"],
  "deny_regions": [],
  "tier_routing": {
    "preferred": ["private", "dedicated", "hosted"],
    "allow_burst_to_lower_tier": false
  },
  "fallback_variants": [
    {"id": "model-x-eu-quant", "region": "eu-central-1", "compatible_with": ["model-x"]},
    {"id": "model-x-eu-fp16", "region": "eu-west-1", "compatible_with": ["model-x"]}
  ],
  "emergency_passthrough_allowed": false
}

Notes: router will reject any decision that would cause egress from EU when residency==EU_ONLY.
